    },

    "semantic_notes": [
        "Rust: .insert(), .push(), .remove(), .pop() on Vec, HashMap, BTreeMap, BTreeSet.",
        "Go: map[key] = value (insert), append(slice, value), delete(map, key).",
        "C: array assignment, linked list manipulation, realloc patterns.",
        "Semantically distinct from method_call: invocation vs mutation intent.",
        "Determines if a section is pure (no mutation) or stateful (has mutation).",
        "A 'queries' section should have method_call but NOT collection_mutation."
